    "name": "Pink Beauty Radish",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pink Beauty radish isa fast-growing (25-29 days), open-pollinated heirloom variety, known for its vibrant, bright pink skin and crisp, mild white flesh. It produces uniform, round-to-oval roots that resist cracking and pithiness even when large. Ideal for spring or fall planting, it grows well in full sun, producing tender radishes that are excellent for salads and fresh eating</span></p>",
